<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Omega says talks off, cautionary withdrawn.</title>
<headline>Omega says talks off, cautionary withdrawn.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronics group Omega Holdings Ltd said on Thursday that unspecified negotiations which it first announced in November had been terminated.</p>
<p>The company gave no further details in a brief statement withdrawing its earlier cautionary announcement.</p>
<p>	  -- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
